{"id": "msg_bc9217edf3b240de94a3a2825c3d9214", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "这几处译错了，或者白话已经立住还挂着原文对照。我按原文改，并去掉对照。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-178__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_0", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch071_seg03.md", "old_string": "　　权奸误国，祸机深重；开国承家，须戒小人。\n　　逆贼深诛何足道，无奈二圣远远蒙尘。\n（原文：权奸误国祸机深，开国承家戒小人。逆贼深诛何足道，奈何二圣远蒙尘。）", "new_string": "　　权奸误国，祸机这么深；开国承家，要戒小人。\n　　逆贼诛得再深也不足道，奈何二圣远在蒙尘。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-179__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_1", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch073_seg07.md", "old_string": "　　酒深了情还不厌，知己说话偏长。\n　　莫辜负了彼此的敬重，\n　　明朝一早请到草堂。\n\n（原文：酒深情不厌，知己话偏长。莫负相钦重，明朝到草堂。）", "new_string": "　　酒深了，情还不厌；\n　　知己的话，偏说得长。\n　　莫负了这一份相钦重，\n　　明朝到草堂。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-180__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_2", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch070_seg00.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：香烟袅，罗帟锦帐风光好。风光好，金钗斜軃，凤颠鸾倒。恍疑身在蓬莱岛，邂逅相逢缘不小。缘不小，最开怀处，蛾眉淡扫。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-181__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_3", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch079_seg08.md", "old_string": "\n　　（原文：比花花解语，比玉玉生香。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-182__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_4", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch078_seg00.md", "old_string": "　　又怎比得上一双鸳鸯。（原文：望江南　梅其雪，岁暮斗新妆。月底素华同弄色，风前轻片半含香，不比柳花狂。双雀影，堪比雪衣娘。六出光中曾结伴，百花头上解寻芳，争似两鸳鸯。）", "new_string": "　　又怎比得上一双鸳鸯。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-183__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_5", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch078_seg02.md", "old_string": "　　惹蝶的芳心，又软又浓。（原文：动人春色娇还媚，惹蝶芳心软欲浓。）", "new_string": "　　惹蝶的芳心，又软又浓。"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-d4954fb2-df45-4065-881b-e956220bc815-184__fc_82f7d057-b204-9c65-9dca-20b5d12ff260_6", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch078_seg02.md", "old_string": "　　起身时残烛映得窗纱一片红。（原文：聚散无凭在梦中，起来残烛映纱红。）", "new_string": "　　起身时残烛映得窗纱一片红。"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:30:50.647Z"}
